{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-01",
  "title": "作戰對策會議",
  "storyCode": "14-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c1423596980c880e2e7792b8c0d0cb75527700e657eaa2eb3cfbe78c5ff4ca48",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g25_wildbattlefield_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有發現薩卡茲部隊的蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“生命脊椎”目標很大，我們墜落的時候動靜更大，他們趕過來恐怕是遲早的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾小姐，可以確定我們現在的位置嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只能根據手上的地圖確認大致方位啦……\n該死，通訊還是毫無反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那具大骨頭摔下來後所有的通訊系統也跟著失靈了，我的無人機都飛不了太遠，這種程度的干擾我以前從來沒遇到過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，無人機好像發現了什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼？錄音機？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是，現在的戰場上除了用嘴，也只能用這種方式傳遞訊息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是開斯特公爵的徽記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……老樣子，沒什麼起色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能轉告你那新認識的老伙計，它再不起來幹活的話，我會一根一根掰斷它留下的骨頭架子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它早就死了，又不知道疼。你想發洩也得找個有意義的對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我們墜落之後，那本來就飄忽不定的聲音更是不再回應任何呼喚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神經束正在枯萎。什麼手段都試過了，潤滑油，營養劑，連我都沒怎麼聽說過的亂七八糟的巫術。結論就是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它現在就是一具沒那麼結實的骸骨，貨真價實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它該不會是徹底死了吧？死掉的巨獸還會再死一遍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊內絲，把那邊骨頭縫裡的雷遞給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……多謝提醒，我差一點就要踩上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，你又準備去發什麼瘋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我準備聽一下你的建議，找更好炸的對象去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們那位老相好，不是跟這骨頭架子最熟了嗎？起碼她的肋骨還連著肉，嘴裡也還能吐出像樣的話。她最好能再說點什麼出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……厄爾蘇拉。她掌握了許多巨獸相關的秘密，也顯然沒有對我們和盤托出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但目前的情形恐怕並不是她能解決的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題的源頭……藏在我們頭頂那片紅色的陰雲裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，什麼都知道的凱爾希，讓我猜猜看，你又給我們帶來了什麼壞消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普通的天災影響不了巨獸。即便……是已經死去幾百年的這一隻。供它穿行的隧道甚至能夠跨越時間，又怎麼可能因風暴而關閉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡發生的事情，已遠非“天災”所能描述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，墜落的那一刻，我隱約感覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骸骨中殘餘的，那古老而巨大的意志……游開了。它去了一個我觸碰不到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它真死了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "它自由了？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……它與我們之間的聯繫斷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許是暫時的，但時間久了，我們很可能徹底失去對它的掌控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的推測是正確的。Logos檢查過了，薩卡茲加諸這具骸骨的巫術正被一股龐大的能量干擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來血魔的儀式確實完成了。赦罪師……奎薩圖什塔正在幫助特雷西斯，實現薩卡茲數千年來都未能做到的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）“阿喃那”。萬古不愈之創，苦難的搖籃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多說點能聽懂的，我等著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是最初的詛咒，也是最初的源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這不是傳說中的玩意嗎？赫德雷天天愛看的故事書裡胡編的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳說是真實的影子，儘管它已經被塗抹得面目全非。更何況，這傳說來自薩卡茲，甚至是提卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來特雷西斯打算弄個不得了的東西掛在維多利亞頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕，這也是他選擇倫蒂尼姆作為自己落腳之處的原因。碎片大廈影響天災與源石的能力已足夠成為“阿喃那”的道標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在如今的泰拉，它也幾乎只可能在這裡降臨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說吧，該怎麼拆了它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……以現在泰拉科技的水準，我們對它無計可施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而唯一的好消息是，它還未徹底降臨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos先生，你有什麼發現？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔掌控的那滴血，被他稱為“提卡茲之血”的那一滴……它仍行使著它的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“阿喃那”之所以能夠跨越萬年歷史，再度降臨，正是因為他的祈願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今血的主人已經墜落，但血脈的聯繫依然穩固。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要阻止“阿喃那”重現於這片大地，我們需要平息血魔的詛咒，令這滴血中包含的怨恨徹底消融。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想……我可以試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與血魔的廝殺沾染了我，影響至今仍未散去，拜此所賜，我能感受到“提卡茲之血”如今脈動的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它就在食腐者的軍陣後方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡高機率會是一座赦罪師的祭壇，但突破整個食腐者防線需要付出的時間成本太高了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們可以穿越赤鬃山脈，繞開大部分的交戰區。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "選這條路的風險不會比突破陣線要小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據觀測報告，赤鬃山脈已經在“阿喃那”的影響下被徹底改造，那裡如今遍布著極端危險的活性化源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……確實可行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閃靈已經先我們一步去尋找奎薩圖什塔，順利的話，她也會成為我們的助力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我支持博士的決定，這確實是最節省時間的方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果繼續拖延下去，等到凱爾希醫生口中的“阿喃那”徹底降臨，並被特雷西斯當作戰場上的武器……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們就徹底失去改變局勢的機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕有風險，我們也必須前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……W小姐，有件事我需要你的協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想找人幫你們守住這骨頭，對吧小兔子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這具骸骨對我們接下來的行動意義重大。而且，赫德雷先生也很需要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從墜落的那一刻起，軍事委員會就無疑盯上了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，好不容易搶來的東西，沒道理那麼輕易還回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說個大致時間吧。現在是……下午六點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……三天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "周遭的地形已經被完全改變，我們得穿越一片充滿未知危險的荒原。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕路加上一定會遭遇的戰鬥，處理“提卡茲之血”起碼需要三天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無法移動的骸骨會成為非常顯眼的目標。對你們來說，守住骸骨，未必比之前突襲骸骨輕鬆……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我建議阿斯卡綸留守“生命脊椎”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我的工作是和你一起行動，並盡力保證你的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那場血魔大君的襲擊中，我的失誤已經讓你負傷。我不希望這樣危險的情況重演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "“生命脊椎”很重要，基本上由曼弗雷德指揮進攻。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你很了解他。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我贊成，薩卡茲在作戰時非常依賴指揮官的臨場判斷。如果能對曼弗雷德進行限制，也許能為雇傭兵分擔一部分壓力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我尊重你們的決議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那幫派不上什麼用場的維多利亞人呢，也和你們一起走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們去銀石崖前線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，區區幾千個人，裡面還有一堆直到幾個月前都沒摸過武器的好好市民……要去和食腐者大軍打仗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲，你們有你們的傳說，我們也有我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸王之息，劈開天災的劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然薩卡茲大軍控制了風暴，那也該是這把劍起作用的時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們收到了開斯特公爵的聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算聯絡，只是一個邀約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我們推測的一樣，薩卡茲的怪東西啟動之後，維多利亞……或者說公爵聯軍遭受了很大的打擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開斯特，不，任何大公爵應該都搞清楚了，維多利亞正處在什麼境況中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都見識過那些冒著紅光，或者其他光的法術祭壇了。目前，倫蒂尼姆外圍戰場，整個都在變成薩卡茲的法陣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是……薩卡茲式的戰鬥。不是萊塔尼亞式，不是烏薩斯式，不是任何一種我們所熟知的戰術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“灰禮帽”一定告訴過開斯特了，薩卡茲會讓他們收集的情報變成廢紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸王之息……我手中這根鐵條，不再僅是讓開斯特渴望放到談判桌上的籌碼。它將給戰局帶來切實的、天翻地覆的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰都不知道下一輪天災什麼時候來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論開斯特的“劍座”是個什麼東西，裝了輪子的方形房子也好，軍官背著的古怪機械也罷，我都會去找到它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平息這些風暴，至少能讓戰場重新變得公平些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從蘇弗里爾峽谷到銀石崖前線，哪怕走公爵們已經清理過的西途林地-吉布森鎮一線，也得花上兩天時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以開斯特公爵的手段，只要一有機會，她就會從你手中奪走諸王之息，以期在艱難戰局中統領眾公爵，讓自己距離王座更近一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且會這樣做的，並不只有她一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫德米爾公爵已經犧牲，她的軍隊也離開了這片戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再有任何一位公爵撤軍，這場戰爭就會變得更艱難，收復倫蒂尼姆的時間就會拖後，因戰爭而死傷的普通人也會更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對薩卡茲也好，對維多利亞人也好，這就是決定最終命運的一戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們……是典範軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡最需要奇蹟，我們就會去哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，如果這把劍真的像傳說中那樣，能令風暴停息，那你們之後去倫蒂尼姆的路，也能更好走些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你怎麼知道我都準備好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "總之呢，你們可靠的首席工程師可露希爾和她的團隊已經研究出了七種抗干擾的通訊方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我部署的設備也已經在分析這場超級天災的趨勢和產生的影響了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哪怕再劇烈，源石引發的反應也有跡可循，粉塵的濃度啦，活性化的指數啦，還有蔓延的狀態——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "當然，這裡恐怕所有的讀數都很高，所以我們沒辦法算出最危險的那些區域會發生什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "但我們能推測出這片戰場上，哪裡相對比較安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "前提是，我們要更加深入這片戰場的中心，拿到更多的數據才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "雖然Misery答應做我們的保鏢啦，但我想，既然大家都要去飛著巫術和炮彈的戰場中心，那我們就是同路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "也許能勞煩典範軍的各位稍微當一下我們的護衛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "義不容辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阻止事情變得更壞，是羅德島的使命，對吧，凱爾希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝你，可露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我和你，還有阿米婭一起走。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "也許我們這條路是最危險的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但我會確保博士的安全……就和以前每一次一樣。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我能去幫助推進之王和可露希爾嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，感謝你的信任。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你的指揮經驗一定能幫到我們。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我更傾向於留在骸骨這邊。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你這提議是認真的？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "小兔子和老女人的寵物不在，我可是想做什麼都能做哦？"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，你擔心每一位幹員的安危，因而對自己的選擇有些猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我需要你與我同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "和你們一起深入敵後？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "去解決那個祭壇？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們最終要面對之物是確定的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“源石”，它塑造了薩卡茲的歷史，也將決定我們每一個人的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許你也曾對羅德島為何會參與這場戰爭心懷疑慮……而過去我並沒有機會解釋，也給不出確切的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我始終懷疑，碎片大廈上空的陰雲裡藏著可怕的東西。當它真的出現在我面前的時候，我依然……百感交集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不習慣於探討命運相關的話題，尤其是你和我的“命運”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是如今，它正在向我們走來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你的語氣很不同尋常。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石能造成的影響，遠遠超過我們每一個人的認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "包括你嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}……我希望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不，我相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你依然是那個能改變一切的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我也從來沒有懷疑過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士……我們該上路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……出發。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用我鳴炮歡送吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W小姐，保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……別忘了小兔子，我和那隻羊不一樣，很難死掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "典範軍準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，推進之王小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸位，我們都必須抓緊時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場戰爭中，每一分每一秒……都有人正在因“源石”而受苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們的使命比任何時候都要清晰。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阻止源石繼續擴散。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "停下“阿喃那”。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，走進陰霾的最深處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……去倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸了那座塔，把最大的混蛋揪出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去阻止眼前的……以及未來可能發生的災難。"
    },
